the mountains","si_tag":"Wellness","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~EUR 30-60/session (approx)","timing":"standing","draw_rank":3,"hook":"ride Aquamotion''s indoor surf wave — the only one in a European ski resort","si":"wellness","blurb":"ride Aquamotion''s indoor surf wave — the only one in a European ski resort","when":"standing","commission":"venue","wells":["stay","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["ski","wellness"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","family":"destination","romance":"destination","ski":"evidenced","ultra":"destination","wellness":"primary"},"commission_lane":["venue"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Moriond Racing — a 3 km toboggan through 8 tunnels","si_tag":"Family","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~EUR 20-30/pp (approx)","timing":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"at Courchevel Moriond, the Moriond Racing sledge run drops 3 km to the village through 8 tunnels, hairpins and a carousel","si":"family","blurb":"at Courchevel Moriond, the Moriond Racing sledge run drops 3 km to the village through 8 tunnels, hairpins and a carousel","when":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","commission":"operator","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["family"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","family":"primary","romance":"destination","ski":"destination","ultra":"destination","wellness":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane","source":"https://www.skipasscourchevel.com/en/moriond-racing-toboggan-run","accessed":"2026-07-17","source_carried":true,"source_basis":"carried from the dossier lane source; the proper noun ''Moriond Racing'' from the jewel name appears in the URL. NOT a human read of the jewel."},{"name":"Family Park + Western Ski Park at Moriond","si_tag":"Family","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"group lessons ~EUR 60-120/day child (approx)","timing":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"gentle freestyle modules, boardercross, a timed slalom and a cowboy-themed learning course — Moriond''s sunny, wide beginner terrain is built for families","si":"family","blurb":"gentle freestyle modules, boardercross, a timed slalom and a cowboy-themed learning course — Moriond''s sunny, wide beginner terrain is built for families","when":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","commission":"school/operator 10-15%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["family","ski"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","family":"primary","romance":"destination","ski":"evidenced","ultra":"destination","wellness":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":15,"commission_lane":["operator","school"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane","source":"https://courchevel.com/en/a/family-park-264436/","accessed":"2026-07-17","source_carried":true,"source_basis":"carried from the dossier lane source; the proper noun ''Family Park'' from the jewel name appears in the URL. NOT a human read of the jewel."},{"name":"A snow-day at Aquamotion","si_tag":"Family","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~EUR 20-40/pp (approx)","timing":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","draw_rank":3,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the surf wave, slides and wild river give kids a full day out when weather closes the slopes — the resort''s family bad-weather insurance","si":"family","blurb":"the surf wave, slides and wild river give kids a full day out when weather closes the slopes — the resort''s family bad-weather insurance","when":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, Feb half-terms + Easter","commission":"venue","wells":["stay","insure"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["family","ski"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","family":"primary","romance":"destination","ski":"evidenced","ultra":"destination","wellness":"destination"},"commission_lane":["venue"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Courchevel?","a":"The mountain, not crime - avalanche off-piste. Courchevel is high alpine terrain (Saulire 2,738 m); check the Meteo-France BERA avalanche bulletin daily (5-level scale, Haute-Tarentaise massif), never ski off-piste without a transceiver, shovel, probe and a qualified guide, and treat closed pistes as closed. Mountain rescue is 112.","source":"meteofrance/savoie.gouv.fr","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"1850 or 1650 (Moriond) - which Courchevel village should I stay in?","a":"Courchevel 1850 is the glamour address - best ski access, luxury shopping, palace hotels and the jet-set scene; Moriond (1650) is more traditional, sunnier (a south-facing sun-trap), better value with a younger apres crowd; Le Praz (1300) is the quiet, characterful base.","source":"oxfordski.com","si_tag":"ski"},{"q":"Do I have to be a millionaire to ski Courchevel?","a":"No - 1850 is genuinely jet-set (palace suites ~EUR2,000-8,000+/night), but you can ski the same 600 km of Les 3 Vallees staying in Moriond, Le Praz or nearby La Tania for a fraction of that. The lift pass and slopes are the same; only the bed and bar bill change. (Nightly rates are seasonal - verify before travel.)","source":"oxfordski.com","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"When is the best time to ski Courchevel?","a":"December-April, with March the sweet spot - reliable high-altitude snow, longer daylight and lighter crowds; January brings the coldest, most reliable cover; late December and February half-terms are busiest and priciest. (Season dates and crowd/price patterns vary by year - verify before travel.)","source":"courchevel.vip","si_tag":"ski"},{"q":"Is there true ski-in/ski-out luxury in Courchevel?","a":"Yes - it''s built for it: Le Strato, Courcheneige and premium catered chalets put you on the snow, and 1850''s five Palace-distinction hotels are steps from the lifts.","source":"powderedition.com","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"Is Courchevel good for beginners and families?","a":"Very - it''s one of the best places in the Alps to learn: each village has its own nursery slopes, and the wide gentle green runs above 1850 plus Moriond''s magic-carpet progression zones and Family Park make it family-gold.","source":"snow-wise.com","si_tag":"family"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Courchevel Travel Guide: Les 3 Vallees Skiing, Palace Hotels & Michelin Stars","meta_description":"Plan Courchevel — the crown jewel of Les 3 Vallees, the world''s largest linked ski area: 600 km of piste, the four altitude villages, five Palace hotels, the most Michelin stars of any ski resort, the mountain altiport, Aquamotion and the 2030 Olympics, with real timing, safety and booking intel.","slug":"courchevel-france","primary_keyword":"Courchevel travel guide","long_tail":["Courchevel Les 3 Vallees ski area","Courchevel villages 1850 1650 Moriond Le Praz","Courchevel palace hotels","Courchevel Michelin restaurants","Courchevel altiport"],"search_language":"fr","local_keywords":["Courchevel guide voyage","domaine skiable Les 3 Vallees","villages de Courchevel 1850 Moriond Le Praz","palaces Courchevel","restaurants etoiles Courchevel","altiport de Courchevel"],"hreflang":["en","fr-FR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-17","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-17","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/france","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:26Z","source_updated":"2026-08-11T10:17:02+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":["terrorism","civil unrest"],"advisory_updated":"accessed 2026-07-17)","note":"Courchevel is an orderly Alpine resort, main on-mountain risk is the alpine environment, not security"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"ski","status":"live","note":"Les 3 Vallées 600km - primary"},{"si":"ultra","status":"live","note":"five Palace-distinction hotels - a jewel IS the ultra experience"},{"si":"culinary","status":"live","note":"most Michelin-starred ski resort on earth"},{"si":"romance","status":"future","note":"palace stays + altiport arrival"},{"si":"wellness","status":"future","note":"Aquamotion + palace spas"},{"si":"family","status":"future","note":"Moriond, Family Park, toboggan"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Cheval Blanc Courchevel (LVMH; Palace distinction)","why_ultra":"LVMH Alpine flagship in 1850, three-Michelin-star Le 1947, couture boutiques, spa, ski-in","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~EUR 2,000-8,000+/night (approx; suites higher)"},{"name":"Airelles Courchevel, Les Airelles (Palace distinction)","why_ultra":"fairytale Austro-Hungarian Palace on Jardin Alpin piste, Courchevel''s first Palace, PieroTT by Pierre Gagnaire","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~EUR 2,000-8,000+/night (approx)"},{"name":"L''Apogee Courchevel (Oetker Collection; Palace distinction)","why_ultra":"Oetker Palace, spacious interconnecting suites, La Prairie spa, indoor pool","earning":"consortia/Oetker on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~EUR 1,800-7,000+/night (approx)"},{"name":"Le K2 Palace (K2 Collections; Palace distinction)","why_ultra":"Himalayan-themed ski-in Palace on Cospillot piste, one-Michelin-star Le K2, private cinema + kids'' spaces","earning":"consortia on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~EUR 1,800-7,000+/night (approx)"},{"name":"Hotel Barriere Les Neiges (Groupe Barriere; Palace distinction)","why_ultra":"ski-in/ski-out on Bellecote piste, resort''s largest spa (1,000 m2+)","earning":"consortia/Barriere on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~EUR 1,500-6,000+/night (approx)"},{"name":"Private-jet/heli altiport arrival + Palace suite + catered ultra-chalet","why_ultra":"world''s-first-mountain-airfield arrival + staffed chalet base + private chef for exclusive-use groups","earning":"air operator + chalet specialist + consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application (approx)"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-17","hero":{"query":"Courchevel, France"},"geo":{"lat":45.4147,"lng":6.6347},"orbit":[{"id":"alpe-dhuez-france","jewels":35,"si":["ski","family","ultra","entertainment","wellness","romance"]},{"id":"chamonix-france","jewels":23,"si":["ski","adventure","hiking","ultra","romance","culture","wellness"]},{"id":"la-plagne-france","jewels":34,"si":["ski","family","adventure","wellness","ultra","romance"]},{"id":"les-deux-alpes-france","jewels":34,"si":["ski","adventure","entertainment","family","wellness","romance"]},{"id":"megeve-france","jewels":33,"si":["ski","ultra","culinary","romance","wellness","family"]},{"id":"meribel-france","jewels":28,"si":["ski","family","romance","ultra","hiking","wellness","culinary"]},{"id":"tignes-france","jewels":24,"si":["ski","family","hiking","wellness","ultra","entertainment"]},{"id":"val-d-isere-france","jewels":27,"si":