  ('alpe-dhuez-france', '01F', 'Alpe d''Huez', 'France', 'The sunny giant of the Oisans', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'French Alps', '{"ski","family","ultra","entertainment","wellness","romance"}', '{"alpine","dramatic","festive"}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Big sunny Grandes Rousses / Oisans domain (Isere): 250+ km of slopes, 135 runs, 300+ sun days; 1,250-3,330 m (Pic Blanc glacier top; ~2,224 m vertical)","The SARENNE - billed by the resort as the longest black run in the world (16 km uninterrupted); Pic Blanc freeride couloirs + XXL snowpark; night skiing at Le Signal","High village 1,860 m; snowmaking ~62 km / ~900 cannons (offsets sunny south aspect); season ~5 Dec 2026-18 Apr 2027; adult day pass ~EUR 66 (6-day/Grand Domaine unverified)","Ski heritage: first drag-lift for skiers 1936; hosted 1968 Olympic bobsleigh (Grenoble Games); the famous 21 hairpin bends cycling climb (13.8 km, 8.1% avg; bends named for TdF winners)","Genuine 5-star tier: Au Chamois d''Or, Grandes Rousses Hotel & Spa, Daria-I Nor + Prestige Odalys L''Eclose (ratings as-listed, verify); 4-stars Pic Blanc, Royal Ours Blanc","Three new lifts for 2026/27 incl a 24-person tricable ropeway Bourg-d''Oisans <-> Alpe d''Huez; US pass affiliation NOT confirmed - do not assert","Tomorrowland Winter EDM festival (from 2019; contract through 2030 but post-2024 status uncertain - verify); lively big-resort apres","HELI-SKIING BANNED IN FRANCE - guided freeride/ski-touring only (ESF/Bureau des Guides Oisans); NO natural hot springs (nearest thermal Uriage-les-Bains/Allevard down-valley - verify)"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 (Europe) / 15 SAMU / 17 police / 18 fire / 114 SMS; mountain rescue via 112 / PGHM (Isere/Oisans)","hospital":"Resort clinic; nearest major hospital CHU Grenoble Alpes (~59 km); heli evac SMUR/PGHM (verify name)","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"High-alpine winter sports: off-piste + Pic Blanc couloirs avalanche risk - Meteo-France BERA, 5-level scale, Grandes-Rousses massif (verify label; keep distinct from Les 2 Alpes ''Oisans''); transceiver/shovel/probe + UIAGM guide; NO heli-skiing (banned in France) - guided freeride only; glacier/crevasse (Pic Blanc 3,330 m) guided; sunny south aspect softens fast + intense high-altitude UV (cat-3/4 protection); the 16 km Sarenne is long/committing; rescue 112/PGHM","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/france","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:26Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:17:02+01:00","source_country":"france","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/New Year, February European half-terms + Easter; + Tomorrowland Winter (mid-March, status-flagged); holiday multiples + min-stay","shoulder":"Early Dec (season opening) + late Mar-Apr spring skiing","green":"May-Nov green season is a genuine second act (21-bends cycling, MTB, hiking); most winter lifts/hotels close","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + Easter + Tomorrowland + top 5-stars 4-8 mo; regular winter 2-4 mo; spring-ski 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Spring-ski value (late Mar-Apr); big summer cycling/MTB/hiking season (the 21 bends)","event_peaks":"Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms, Easter, Tomorrowland Winter (mid-Mar, dates/status verify)","fire_date":"Next winter + 5-stars from prior spring (4-8 mo); spring-ski from January; summer cycling from spring; lead with ''sunniest big domain + longest black run''"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski the 250 km sunny domain","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"adult day ~EUR 66; instructor ~300-600/day","timing":"ski early Dec-late Apr","draw_rank":1,"hook":"one of the largest, sunniest single ski areas in the French Alps","si":"ski","blurb":"one of the largest, sunniest single ski areas in the French Alps","when":